WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Last step — your first win.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Copy the prompt and open Grok or Claude.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Paste it in and send.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Your trainer says hi, then asks for an inbox screenshot.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Send it and get today / wait / skip plus draft replies.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.000
You read them and you send them. That's your first win.
